WEBVTT

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:19.770
That being the case,
Kobayashi has been formally impeached.

00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:29.321
As we agreed, I will take over
as the next representative.

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:30.697
I object.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.035
He is Ochiai's clone.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:37.454
How long have you been here?!

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:42.876
What are you doing?!

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.466
Wait, don't!

00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:15.284
It is finished.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.496
An admirable job.

00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:29.756
LEM STAR SYSTEM

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.718
Set Sidonia's course
to the Lem Star System.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.679
As you wish.

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:42.561
<i>Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light!</i></i>

00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:51.862
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:58.619
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:02.789
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:12.716
<i>Our only haven is this fortress</i>

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:15.802
<i>Wandering among the stars</i>

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:19.056
<i>Where we tremble with impatience</i>

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:21.475
<i>Between life and death</i>

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:27.230
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:32.069
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:40.202
<i>Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here</i></i>

00:02:40.952 --> 00:02:46.917
<i>Carry within ourselves the will to fight</i>

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.545
<i>Our lives shine their brightest</i>

00:02:50.629 --> 00:02:53.048
<i>In the defense of love</i>

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.010
<i>We boldly enter the fray</i>

00:02:57.094 --> 00:03:01.515
<i>The Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.483
COURSE

00:03:26.123 --> 00:03:27.707
SEVENTH PLANET: SEVEN

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:29.501
LEM STAR SYSTEM: LEM
NINTH PLANET: NINE

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:32.504
The gauna cluster is

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:35.215
closing in on the Lem Star System.

00:03:37.509 --> 00:03:40.303
Seven, the seventh planet
in the Lem Star System...

00:03:40.387 --> 00:03:43.473
...was the planet
the Sidonian colonists landed on.

00:03:45.016 --> 00:03:49.146
The gauna continue
to invade our territory.

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:56.862
These aggressive creatures
cannot be communicated with,

00:03:57.279 --> 00:04:00.282
and there is only one way
that humanity can survive.

00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:02.951
We must eliminate the threat.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.745
In other words,

00:04:05.036 --> 00:04:08.999
we must eradicate every last gauna
from the universe.

00:04:10.876 --> 00:04:14.004
Our plan has already been
set in motion.

00:04:14.755 --> 00:04:18.341
Sidonia has set course
for the Lem Star System.

00:04:21.803 --> 00:04:24.222
Our destination is Planet Nine.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:29.186
This planet is located in the blind spot
from Planet Seven's orbit.

00:04:30.061 --> 00:04:32.939
Sidonia will enter
this satellite orbit,

00:04:33.148 --> 00:04:35.901
and use the group of satellites
as a natural defense

00:04:36.318 --> 00:04:38.278
to attack the gauna cluster.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:39.863
GAUNA CLUSTER
INVADES THE LEM STAR SYSTEM!!

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:41.615
<i>That was the statement
<i>from military command.</i></i>

00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:45.410
<i>Once they have made preparations,
<i>they will attack the gauna cluster.</i></i>

00:04:45.786 --> 00:04:47.496
<i>The military has also raised</i>

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:49.748
<i>the state of emergency
<i>to threat Level 10.</i></i>

00:04:50.332 --> 00:04:52.417
<i>We should expect sudden
<i>emergency accelerations...</i></i>

00:04:52.584 --> 00:04:54.127
Unbelievable.

00:04:54.461 --> 00:04:57.255
When did these things
get decided?

00:04:58.465 --> 00:05:00.300
The assembly's been suspended.

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:06.056
The captain is making
all of the decisions now.

00:05:10.769 --> 00:05:12.562
<i>The assembly has been suspended?!</i>

00:05:12.729 --> 00:05:15.440
<i>The Immortal Council
<i>would never agree to that.</i></i>

00:05:16.107 --> 00:05:17.400
NIGHT CYCLE DURATION TO BE EXTENDED
TO CONSERVE ELECTRICITY.

00:05:17.484 --> 00:05:19.444
No to gauna hybrids!

00:05:19.736 --> 00:05:22.781
No to gauna hybrids!

00:05:22.948 --> 00:05:25.575
REMEMBER THE TRAGEDY A CENTURY AGO!

00:05:26.076 --> 00:05:28.954
No to gauna hybrids!

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:32.791
-The days have gotten a little shorter.
-Yeah.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:38.046
The military should call off
this state of emergency!

00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:40.090
Call it off!

00:05:40.257 --> 00:05:42.300
The hybrid is a gauna!

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:44.678
Do not let the gauna inside Sidonia!

00:05:44.886 --> 00:05:47.597
Don't let the gauna inside Sidonia!

00:05:47.722 --> 00:05:50.308
Remember the tragedy a century ago!

00:05:51.142 --> 00:05:52.936
Let's go, Nagate.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.648
No to gauna hybrids!

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:59.776
No to gauna hybrids!

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:02.988
No to gauna hybrids!

00:06:25.677 --> 00:06:29.431
Could you test the purity
of the superstructure?

00:06:29.848 --> 00:06:33.101
It's nothing like the material
we used for the previous models.

00:06:33.184 --> 00:06:35.520
These numbers
are on the level of the hybrid.

00:06:48.575 --> 00:06:52.287
This is the new material
jointly developed

00:06:52.454 --> 00:06:54.080
with Kunato Developments.

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:02.922
It seems sturdy.

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:06.551
But it's also very lightweight.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:10.972
We applied the same principles
as the gauna core shell to the structure.

00:07:11.848 --> 00:07:18.688
But only Toa Heavy Industries could
have managed to develop it this quickly.

00:07:22.651 --> 00:07:24.152
Of course.

00:07:24.402 --> 00:07:26.029
I have years of experience.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:29.866
You're not doing too bad
for a kid just starting out.

00:07:32.702 --> 00:07:35.246
How many Mark 18s
will you be able to build

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:38.792
from these new materials
before we reach the Lem Star System?

00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:42.295
You're the one who told us to prioritize
building a new Tsugumori

00:07:42.379 --> 00:07:43.964
from these new materials.

00:07:45.715 --> 00:07:50.136
With the Mark 18s we have now...

00:07:50.679 --> 00:07:54.182
I'd say we could probably reinforce
the cockpits for about 60 units.

00:07:54.265 --> 00:07:56.184
Don't make it sound so easy.

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:21.001
How did you...?!

00:08:21.459 --> 00:08:24.421
This wasn't even recorded
in Ochiai's Auxiliary Brain.

00:08:27.007 --> 00:08:29.634
It wasn't anything worth recording.

00:08:30.218 --> 00:08:34.139
It was as simple as in the tales
they tell about

00:08:34.472 --> 00:08:36.349
the scientist Ochiai.

00:08:37.058 --> 00:08:38.309
Which means?

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:40.645
We impregnated a humanoid ena

00:08:41.146 --> 00:08:43.356
with a human baby.

00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:50.572
<i>Not long after that,</i>

00:08:50.905 --> 00:08:54.367
<i>he completed the hybrid specimen
<i>as he promised.</i></i>

00:08:54.951 --> 00:08:57.412
<i>Was I right to propose this...</i>

00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:00.248
<i>to the captain?</i>

00:09:19.517 --> 00:09:25.398
SITES OF SIDONIA
SIDONIA'S OLDEST CONVERTER REACTOR PIPE

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.493
That must be the Lem Star System.

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:38.703
Wow, you can see it from here?

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:41.539
-Yes.
-Can you see the colonists?

00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:43.291
No, I can't see quite that far.

00:09:43.458 --> 00:09:48.713
I hear the gauna cluster is slowly
making its way to the Lem Star System.

00:09:48.963 --> 00:09:50.632
I hope they're okay.

00:09:50.965 --> 00:09:55.178
We need to worry about that gauna cluster
more than the colonists.

00:09:56.304 --> 00:10:01.726
We have no way to defeat it
with what we have in Sidonia now.

00:10:03.061 --> 00:10:07.315
But there's a chance that we don't
even need to fight it, right?

00:10:07.649 --> 00:10:09.109
That's absurd.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:13.279
Is that your view as a member
of Sidonia's military force?

00:10:13.863 --> 00:10:16.699
That we should just try to sneak past it,

00:10:16.866 --> 00:10:19.536
praying that the enemy
doesn't do anything?

00:10:20.453 --> 00:10:23.915
That is a nest of evil creatures.

00:10:24.249 --> 00:10:26.626
We have no other choice but to fight.

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.296
That is why we need to arm ourselves

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:34.551
with the weapons we need to destroy
our enemies as soon as possible.

00:10:37.095 --> 00:10:40.265
I want to eliminate the gauna as well.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.768
I don't think we have any other choice
but to fight them for now.

00:10:43.852 --> 00:10:46.938
But there are many
different kinds of gauna.

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:48.356
There's still a chance

00:10:48.523 --> 00:10:52.068
we can negotiate for peace one day.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.822
That sentiment may get you killed,
Tanikaze.

00:10:56.364 --> 00:11:00.493
Have you forgotten how many times
the Crimson Hawk Moth nearly killed you?

00:11:00.827 --> 00:11:03.663
Why are you always
so condescending, Kunato?

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:06.040
I mean, we're the same age.

00:11:08.209 --> 00:11:09.377
Hey, Izana.

00:11:09.544 --> 00:11:11.087
What is it?

00:11:11.462 --> 00:11:15.466
Could I see that picture of the cat again?

00:11:15.633 --> 00:11:18.136
Yeah, sure. Here.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:23.600
It looks so fluffy and soft.

00:11:23.766 --> 00:11:25.643
I'll go take you to see one next time.

00:11:25.727 --> 00:11:27.103
Really?!

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:28.438
I'd love that!

00:11:28.605 --> 00:11:30.148
Thank you so much!

00:11:33.776 --> 00:11:34.944
What is it?

00:11:35.612 --> 00:11:38.031
-En woke up?!
-What?

00:11:38.489 --> 00:11:39.824
En Honoka.

00:11:39.991 --> 00:11:42.493
She was knocked unconscious
in that battle a while ago.

00:11:51.461 --> 00:11:54.339
Are you okay?
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:11:56.382 --> 00:11:57.634
How long...

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:00.511
have I been out?

00:12:00.803 --> 00:12:02.472
Wait...

00:12:02.972 --> 00:12:06.559
I was fighting the gauna.

00:12:16.361 --> 00:12:18.404
We didn't detonate at the same time?

00:12:19.989 --> 00:12:21.699
What happened to that gauna?

00:12:23.117 --> 00:12:25.578
Tanikaze!
He screwed up our detonation!

00:12:25.787 --> 00:12:29.332
En, calm down.
I'll tell you about that later.

00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:33.544
Oh, so is there anything
you want to do?

00:12:39.008 --> 00:12:41.803
I want to photosynthesize.

00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:51.479
All I could think of getting
her were rice balls,

00:12:51.646 --> 00:12:54.565
but she's been asleep all this time.
She has to be hungry!

00:12:55.942 --> 00:12:57.276
She's going to love these.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.368
Okay!

00:13:41.529 --> 00:13:43.614
Rice balls...

00:13:57.754 --> 00:14:00.840
<i>Residential Tower District 3
<i>will be sunny</i></i>

00:14:01.007 --> 00:14:03.092
<i>and clear until lights out
<i>for climate control.</i></i>

00:14:04.635 --> 00:14:06.512
Oh, Tanikaze!

00:14:11.642 --> 00:14:14.353
En wants to apologize.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:15.813
Do you have some time now?

00:14:17.065 --> 00:14:18.149
En!

00:14:43.716 --> 00:14:45.968
<i>The sudden appearance
<i>of the hybrid specimen</i></i>

00:14:46.052 --> 00:14:47.970
<i>and its intervention in our battle,</i>

00:14:48.096 --> 00:14:50.681
<i>and the declaration of war
<i>against the gauna cluster...</i></i>

00:14:50.932 --> 00:14:52.225
GAUNA CLUSTER APPROACHING
LEM STAR SYSTEM

00:14:53.684 --> 00:14:56.646
<i>The captain has made some
<i>uncharacteristic moves lately.</i></i>

00:14:56.938 --> 00:14:59.982
TSUMUGI: SEARCH

00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:02.193
GAUNA AND HUMAN HYBRID SPECIMEN
THE HYBRID SPECIMEN JOINS COMBAT

00:15:07.281 --> 00:15:10.034
"The gauna and human hybrid specimen,

00:15:10.326 --> 00:15:13.037
the hybrid specimen joins combat."

00:15:15.498 --> 00:15:19.001
"Kunato Developments Representative
calls for an open meeting."

00:15:21.045 --> 00:15:22.672
This isn't the information I wanted.

00:15:23.381 --> 00:15:25.174
UNABLE TO ACCESS

00:15:25.508 --> 00:15:28.219
CLASSIFIED: ACCESS DENIED

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:30.221
ACCESS PERMISSION: GRANTED

00:15:30.721 --> 00:15:33.266
TSUMUGI SHIRAUI
HYBRID SPECIMEN

00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:36.894
<i>Tsumugi was made from that ena?</i>

00:15:38.062 --> 00:15:42.525
SEARCH HISTORY
NAGATE TANIKAZE

00:15:43.651 --> 00:15:45.319
Tanikaze...

00:15:58.458 --> 00:16:00.918
Oh, Mr. Tanikaze! Izana!

00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:03.296
Oh, Yuhata, what are you doing here?

00:16:03.671 --> 00:16:05.756
I came to inform her
about the precautions

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:08.843
for the mixed clasp formation
drills for our study of the hybrid.

00:16:09.177 --> 00:16:10.219
Oh, really?

00:16:10.428 --> 00:16:12.054
As the probationary subcommander,

00:16:12.138 --> 00:16:15.099
it's my duty to assess
our combat capabilities.

00:16:15.725 --> 00:16:19.270
It seems like you two meet
with Tsumugi quite frequently.

00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:22.482
Yeah, since we're going to be doing
clasp formations with Tsumugi tomorrow,

00:16:22.565 --> 00:16:24.233
we thought we'd hold hands.

00:16:24.734 --> 00:16:26.819
Pilots still believe that superstition?

00:16:28.488 --> 00:16:30.406
Is it some good luck ritual?

00:16:30.823 --> 00:16:32.909
They say that you will fail
a clasp formation,

00:16:33.075 --> 00:16:35.286
if you do it with someone
you've never touched before.

00:16:35.495 --> 00:16:38.122
I know, how about the four of us
put our hands together!

00:16:38.331 --> 00:16:39.457
What?

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.125
Yeah, let's do it!

00:16:41.501 --> 00:16:42.835
Yes!

00:16:42.919 --> 00:16:44.086
You too, Yuhata.

00:16:45.338 --> 00:16:47.507
No, I mean...

00:16:47.673 --> 00:16:49.592
I'm not a pilot.

00:16:49.884 --> 00:16:51.802
Who cares about that! Come on!

00:16:54.472 --> 00:16:55.806
Okay then.

00:16:56.182 --> 00:16:57.391
You win.

00:17:02.021 --> 00:17:03.397
Now we'll be okay.

00:17:28.881 --> 00:17:31.050
<i>Hybrid specimen Tsumugi Shiraui.</i>

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:32.635
<i>Today we will be performing</i>

00:17:32.802 --> 00:17:35.096
<i>a mixed clasp formation
<i>drill with the garde squad.</i></i>

00:17:37.557 --> 00:17:39.308
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:17:39.684 --> 00:17:41.686
Yes, I'm ready!

00:17:54.865 --> 00:17:58.202
High concentration of Heigus particles
detected directly ahead of our course!

00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:01.247
-It's the gauna!
-How far?

00:18:02.206 --> 00:18:04.959
Roughly 600,000 kilometers to Sidonia!

00:18:05.418 --> 00:18:07.378
That's within the Level 3 security border!

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:10.590
We failed to detect its cloaking again?

00:18:10.923 --> 00:18:11.924
Incoming visuals!

00:18:12.174 --> 00:18:16.053
LIVE
GAUNA: GAUNA 550 ANALYSIS

00:18:16.262 --> 00:18:17.346
Wait...

00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:21.726
This is the ship carrying the colonists
heading for the Lem Star System.

00:18:22.268 --> 00:18:25.855
Now we know why we lost contact.
The gauna got to them.

00:18:26.564 --> 00:18:31.152
The enemy Gauna 550
has an estimated 500 cores within!

00:18:31.652 --> 00:18:34.530
It has turned towards Sidonia
and has released gauna!

00:18:34.614 --> 00:18:35.990
Cancel the drills.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.284
Proceed to exterminate the gauna.

00:18:38.618 --> 00:18:40.286
Garde squad, prepare for deployment!

00:18:41.037 --> 00:18:44.332
<i>This is hybrid specimen Tsumugi
<i>and her pilot Kunato.</i></i>

00:18:44.582 --> 00:18:47.710
<i>We will be able to intercept the gauna
<i>sooner if we operate alone.</i></i>

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:49.378
<i>May we deploy?</i>

00:18:49.712 --> 00:18:52.465
No. Join the garde formation
with the others.

00:18:52.632 --> 00:18:57.219
<i>Tsumugi could easily destroy
<i>that level of gauna on her own.</i></i>

00:18:57.678 --> 00:19:00.306
I'm giving you permission
for advance deployment.

00:19:00.389 --> 00:19:04.268
I want to see more
of what this hybrid can do.

00:19:04.727 --> 00:19:06.854
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:19:08.356 --> 00:19:09.690
Kunato! Tsumugi!

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.568
We'll be right behind you!
Be careful!

00:19:13.903 --> 00:19:14.987
Okay!

00:19:15.321 --> 00:19:17.865
Hybrid specimen Tsumugi,
thrusters ready!

00:19:24.622 --> 00:19:26.457
Shiraui, deploying!

00:19:45.685 --> 00:19:49.021
The number of gauna units Gauna 550
has launched just passed 100 units!

00:19:49.397 --> 00:19:50.231
GAUNA 550
TSUMUGI: HYBRID

00:19:50.314 --> 00:19:52.233
Garde squad,
preparing for deployment.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:56.654
All units are being outfitted with max
capacity gauna core-piercing rounds.

00:19:58.781 --> 00:20:01.325
<i>The hybrid went off on her own?</i>

00:20:01.575 --> 00:20:03.160
Against so many gauna?

00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:05.287
It's suicide!

00:20:15.214 --> 00:20:18.467
Hybrid specimen Tsumugi will make
contact with the target momentarily.

00:20:18.551 --> 00:20:19.719
TSUMUGI: HYBRID
ESTIMATED CONTACT POINT

00:20:19.802 --> 00:20:22.847
The gauna units are spreading
into a circular formation!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.724
Sudden ena expansion!

00:20:25.433 --> 00:20:26.934
The enas are connecting.

00:20:27.101 --> 00:20:29.311
Their cores are starting to link together!

00:20:34.817 --> 00:20:35.943
<i>Something's not right.</i>

00:20:37.945 --> 00:20:40.656
It's a trap! Tsumugi, stop!

00:20:47.538 --> 00:20:48.622
What is going on...

00:20:48.873 --> 00:20:49.915
This is...

00:20:50.332 --> 00:20:52.460
It's a net created from ena.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:55.254
Tsumugi has been caught
inside with the gauna!

00:20:55.588 --> 00:20:57.840
Heigus transmission
is being blocked by the ena.

00:20:58.174 --> 00:21:00.176
We've lost communication with Tsumugi!

00:21:29.497 --> 00:21:32.041
<i>West 4 Deployment Gate, all clear.</i>

00:21:32.291 --> 00:21:33.375
<i>Launch!</i>

00:21:33.667 --> 00:21:35.294
Tanikaze, launching!

00:21:59.109 --> 00:22:00.444
<i>Ninety-six clasp formation!</i>

00:22:00.694 --> 00:22:01.862
<i>Copy that!</i>

00:22:28.847 --> 00:22:30.266
<i>Please let us be in time.</i>

00:22:40.818 --> 00:22:42.403
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.824 --> 00:22:50.786
<i>Oh, if this world must decay</i>

00:22:50.869 --> 00:22:54.540
<i>And I'm destined to give my life away</i>

00:22:54.623 --> 00:22:59.712
<i>What should I be living for?</i>

00:23:01.297 --> 00:23:05.634
<i>If I had never met you</i>

00:23:05.718 --> 00:23:09.305
<i>I would never have known</i>

00:23:09.388 --> 00:23:15.311
<i>This pain that tears at my heart</i>

00:23:15.394 --> 00:23:17.730
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-Echoing there</i></i>

00:23:17.813 --> 00:23:19.815
<i>-Fortune
<i>-In the furthest reaches of the cosmos</i></i>

00:23:19.898 --> 00:23:22.818
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Is this clumsy requiem</i></i>

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:25.195
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-And yet</i></i>

00:23:25.279 --> 00:23:27.114
<i>-Fortune
<i>-I'm still searching</i></i>

00:23:27.197 --> 00:23:30.534
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Within this uncertain reality</i></i>

00:23:31.118 --> 00:23:32.620
<i>For you</i>

00:23:32.703 --> 00:23:36.332
<i>The joy of our finding each other</i>

00:23:36.415 --> 00:23:40.044
<i>The vanished warmth</i>

00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:43.756
<i>You should know that I remember it all</i>

00:23:43.839 --> 00:23:47.509
<i>Because I loved you</i>

00:23:47.593 --> 00:23:51.180
<i>The emotions that arise</i>

00:23:51.263 --> 00:23:54.808
<i>The scars left in my heart</i>

00:23:54.892 --> 00:23:59.229
<i>You should know that I'll carry them all</i>

00:23:59.313 --> 00:24:05.903
<i>As I walk this path</i>
